{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Approach, check, process and take object. Move to new location after. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = ProcessObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToNewLocation    /> <SubTree ID = MobileRobotTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    />",
